    "detailed_description": "The best way to experience the classic snake game on steam, with a new game mode where you'll need to escape from bullets coming from everywhere, make sure to catch as many stars and power-ups as your snake-like ship keeps growing, such as:<br />\r\n- Cutter: cut your snake in half.<br />\r\n- Timer: slow the speed down to standart as bullets move in slow motion.<br />\r\n- Portal: transform all walls around you so you can travel faster through the cage.<br />\r\n Progress through different types of enemies in arcade mode as you get closer to a final confrontation.",
